W standard_blackbox_continuations%s  standard_blackbox_continuations.adb  standard_blackbox_continuations.ali
W standard_random_numbers%s  standard_random_numbers.adb  standard_random_numbers.ali
W standard_scaling%s	standard_scaling.adb	standard_scaling.ali

